02:0003C882 0003C896        	  7221:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003C886 0003C896        	  7222:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003C88A 0003C896        	  7223:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
