02:0003EBE0 4E75            	 11980:     rts
                            	 11981: 
                            	 11982:     even
                            	 11983: UpdateLamnola:
                            	 11984:     ; If the direction of this segment is not set, then it has not started
                            	 11985:     ; moving yet. So, return.
