                            	  5954:     ; Link has caught the boomerang.
                            	  5955:     ;
                            	  5956:     ; Combine Link's state with $20 for having caught the boomerang.
                            	  5957:     ;
                            	  5958:     ; If Link catches it some time after throwing it,
                            	  5959:     ; his state will become $20, and he will show the catch animation.
                            	  5960:     ;
                            	  5961:     ; But if he catches it right after throwing it, the state becomes
                            	  5962:     ; $30 ($10 OR $20), which is the end state of using an item.
                            	  5963:     ;
