                            	  7565:     ; We want to handle "enemies from the edges of the screen".
                            	  7566:     ;
                            	  7567:     ; So, if not in UW, or "enemies from edges" attribute is clear,
                            	  7568:     ; or the object is (zora, fire, armos, whirlwind), or any object
                            	  7569:     ; that does not spawn with a cloud (type >= $53);
                            	  7570:     ; 
                            	  7571:     ; then go initialize the object.
                            	  7572:     ;
